      <activity id="a9209fa6-d6bb-5fd1-ac6e-150c07c3d989" activityNameId="cf30cddb-3787-5aaa-b404-5869eef3b00a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler modulating &gt;100kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler modulating &gt;100kW
NOx and CO emissions derived from measurements under controlled conditions;
UUID: 3b3545b6-561a-36c3-ac77-5e648b0b1d74
The module includes fuel input from high pressure (RER) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Emission data extrapolated from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: Models on market
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturers; CO and NOx emissions from (SVGW 2002), sample size (number of selected devices for which emission values are given in SVGW list): CO 26 , NOx 43 . 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b3545b6-561a-36c3-ac77-5e648b0b1d74.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
